{{- /*
Private config for the Calendar CLI MailMate bundle.

Rendered by chezmoi so the bundle repo itself stays generic and public: the
bundle's add.fish sources this file when present and falls back to safe
defaults when it is absent. The work domain and calendar routing live here,
templated from chezmoi data — never committed to the bundle repo.

Contract (bundle reads these; unset -> bundle defaults = everything personal):
  CALCLI_WORK_DOMAIN                email domain that routes to the work calendar
  CALCLI_WORK_CALENDAR_NAME         calendar name for work events
  CALCLI_WORK_CALENDAR_ACCOUNT      calendar account for work events
  CALCLI_PERSONAL_CALENDAR_NAME     calendar name for personal events
  CALCLI_PERSONAL_CALENDAR_ACCOUNT  calendar account for personal events
  CALCLI_WORK_RULES                 "1" enables employer-specific rules
                                    (e.g. Time Off Request -> @work reminder)

Gated on .work.domain (populated on personal/work machines, "" on wife/child),
so work routing matches current behaviour wherever a work account exists.
*/ -}}
# Managed by chezmoi (dot_config/calendar-cli-mmbundle/config.fish.tmpl) — do not edit.
{{ if .work.domain -}}
set -gx CALCLI_WORK_DOMAIN "{{ .work.domain }}"
set -gx CALCLI_WORK_CALENDAR_NAME "Calendar"
set -gx CALCLI_WORK_CALENDAR_ACCOUNT "work"
set -gx CALCLI_WORK_RULES "1"
{{- else -}}
set -gx CALCLI_WORK_DOMAIN ""
set -gx CALCLI_WORK_RULES "0"
{{- end }}
set -gx CALCLI_PERSONAL_CALENDAR_NAME "Josh"
set -gx CALCLI_PERSONAL_CALENDAR_ACCOUNT "local"
